dotengine/godot/pulls/122352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122352","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122352.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122352.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-13T23:58:48Z"},"body":"- [Relevant RC thread](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/core?msg=NGo2iSPDZouJyEbmq)\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFor the longest time, it's only been possible to bind enum class for core types. What's more, the non-core enum constant binds had to exactly match the value names. This PR accomodates both with new `_EXT` macros that accept name overrides for passed values.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdded tests in  `test_method_bind.cpp` for both unscoped enum binds and enum class binds.\r\n\r\nThe way we bind enums as a whole is woefully inefficent & should be overhauled in the near future, but this is a reasonable starting point.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122352/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"